/**
 * FF ABOUT MODAL
 *
 * Built using home-page patterns ONLY. No invented sections, no improvised
 * geometry. Every section maps to a pattern that exists on app/page.tsx.
 *
 * Pattern map:
 *   1. Hero        → mirrors HomepageHero (text left, image right, pt-24, min-h-78vh)
 *   2. About us    → mirrors home Insights pattern (cream bg, eyebrow + h2 + lead row)
 *   3. Who we are  → mirrors home Insights header pattern (white bg for alternation)
 *   4. Our team    → mirrors home Insights cards pattern (3-col cards on cream bg)
 *   5. CTA strip   → CtaStrip wine variant (locked component)
 *   6. Footer      → SiteFooter (locked component)
 *
 * Section bg progression: cream → cream → white → cream → wine → ink
 * No two adjacent sections share the same bg without a divider.
 *
 * If anything here looks different from home, it is content swap only —
 * structure and class names are copied verbatim from app/page.tsx.
 */

